[en.IDEA_C06_SLAVE_TRADE]
Slave Trade

[en.IDEA_C06_SLAVE_TRADE_desc]
Manehattan is a city of opportunity, to both ordinary ponies and slave traders. At least Mayor Gladmane has fulfilled his campaign slogan: “We will give every pony a job!”

[zh.IDEA_C06_SLAVE_TRADE]
奴隶贸易

[zh.IDEA_C06_SLAVE_TRADE_desc]
马哈顿是一座机遇的城市——对普通小马和奴隶贩子来说都是如此。至少乐善市长认真兑现了他的竞选口号：“我们将给每一只小马一个工作！”
